OL,3,GNEWSAFamily's 'painful week' over
OL,4,Amurder investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a woman found dead at the
OL,7,Fbase of cliffs in Alderney have thanked
OL,8,Fthe tiny island's community during an
OL,9,F"unimaginably painful week".
OL,11,FHannah Benfield, 34, was found in the
OL,12,Fsea at the base of cliffs in the west
OL,13,Fof the island on Monday, Guernsey
OL,14,FPolice said.
OL,16,FA 44-year-old man has been arrested on
OL,17,Fsuspicion of her murder and he remains
OL,18,Fin police custody.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
